      "chapter_id": "ch-8b4efe89-fb7b-409d-b1a3-add93697c650",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-7a561733-5f3f-4689-b31f-f948ba059b78",
      "chapter_id": "ch-de86b19d-01f9-4226-a6e1-777b9d39c749",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "sha256": "640927d1eac69fe6ff8247bbfbb362071d6d8421fe6e6ec6901da4a44471ccb6"
    },
    {
